<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is a macro to get rid of the insane recoil on Twitch's F2
What it does: When firing in ADS on F2 as Twitch, it prevents the upward kick of the gun. Very useful for maintaining aim on the F2.

Ingame Configuration:
Weapon: F2 (operator is Twitch)
Attachments: Vertical Grip, any 1x sight, Flash Hider

Macro Configuration &amp; Customization:
Bind the macro to your fire button and set it to "run until stop clicking"
This is designed for 1920x1080. If you are on a different resolution, you can change the y and x values under macro customization.
Higher y value = more downard movement
Llower y value = less downward movement
You can also change x value to compensate for horizontal recoil.

Note: Make sure to only fire in ADS and stop shooting right before you run out of bullets.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 1 ms
MoveR -2 15
Delay 3 ms
Delay 6 ms
Delay 9 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>